120 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 79 0 R
/E (At MedicPreneur, we bridge the gap between medicine and entrepreneurship in Africa. But let me be honest with you about why that gap exists, and why closing it matters so deeply to all of us.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
121 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 79 0 R
/E (There is a real problem that healthcare students face right now, in classrooms and clinics across this continent. How do you hold your academic ambitions in one hand and your entrepreneurial dreams in the other,  without dropping either? How do you survive the demands of medical school and still pursue the life you actually want to build?)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
122 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 79 0 R
/E (We know how difficult, how almost impossible it can feel to focus on your studies and still chase the bigger picture. And we know this not just from observation. We know it because many of us have lived it.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
123 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
