/P 79 0 R
/E <>
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
124 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 79 0 R
/E (The financial reality of healthcare workers who depend solely on clinical skills has long been troubling. Talented, hardworking professionals,  underpaid, undervalued, and without the tools to build income independently. Meanwhile, it is the hospitals, the institutions, that accumulate enough to reinvest, to grow, to give back.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
125 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 79 0 R
/E (This is not a criticism of the system. It is a call to change it. Because medicine is not just a calling and a passion. It is a profession, and every profession must be able to sustain the people who dedicate their lives to it.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
