/E (At Medicpreneur, our mission is to equip healthcare students with the practical insights and strategies needed to balance academic excellence and entrepreneurial success. We aim to guide those without business ideas to discover and develop profitable ventures and provide comprehensive training on running successful businesses post- graduation. Through tailored programs and expert mentorship, we aspire to create a community of medical professionals who are not only healthcare providers but also innovative entrepreneurs.)
