/P 83 0 R
/E (Our journey officially began on July 14th with our inaugural international webinar, spearheaded by the MedicPreneur Zambia chapter in partnership with the University of Zambia Medical Students Association. This event, attended by 132 registered students from 7 countries, featured Prof. Wilbroad Mutale \(CEO, Teledoc\) and our Founder, Moses Adetoro. It was here that we validated our core thesis: medical students are eager to transition from passive learners to active innovators.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [20]
