/P 83 0 R
/E (Our influence culminated in September with two major milestones. First, we partnered with the Federation of African Medical Students Association \(FAMSA\) on September 6th for their Health Innovation Exchange Summit. This partnership cemented our position as a key player in shaping the future of African healthcare leadership. Shortly after, on September 20th, the Ghana Chapter hosted a high-impact session for 137 members across 4 countries, reinforcing our commitment to giving students the practical tools to merge clinical rigor with business viability.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [22]
