/P 86 0 R
/E (For the latter part of last year, our conversations at MedicPreneur  focused on the delicate art of balancing rigorous academic pursuits with entrepreneurial ambition. We explored how to build businesses without failing exams.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
329 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 86 0 R
/E (But as we stepped into 2026, I realized that to truly redefine the future of African healthcare, we cannot simply "balance" academics, we must master them. The most impactful healthcare entrepreneurs are first and foremost, competent healthcare professionals.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [18]
>>
endobj
330 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 86 0 R
/E (That was why, in January , we invested heavily in the academic lives of healthcare students across Africa.)
/Pg 17 0 R
