335 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 86 0 R
/E (The healthcare landscape in Africa is evolving rapidly. While medical professionals are rigorously trained in clinical excellence, there remains a significant gap in business acumen. For many Optometrists, the focus has historically been strictly on patient care, often at the expense of financial sustainability and growth.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [24]
>>
endobj
336 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 86 0 R
/E (The reality is that the business of health professions has always been as vital as the practice itself. Beyond the clinical practice lies the real challenge: sustainability. Many Optometrists fail to reach their full financial potential not because of a lack of medical skill, but because they lack the necessary business strategies, branding insights, and sales proficiency to thrive in a competitive market.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [25]
>>
endobj
337 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 86 0 R
/E (MedicPreneur seeks to bridge this gap between medicine and entrepreneurship in Africa. This event is the first in a series of profession-specific programs designed to equip healthcare providers with the "business of their profession.")
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [26]
>>
endobj
338 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 86 0 R
/E (The primary goal is to transform Optometrists from purely clinical practitioners into "Opto-preneurs.")
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [27]
>>
endobj
